# LMS API Reference

## Setup — Register routes in app.js

```js
import lmsRoutes from './routers/lmsRoutes.js';
app.use('/api/lms', lmsRoutes);
```

All routes require JWT in the Authorization header:
```
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

---

## COURSES

### POST /api/lms/courses
**Role:** Tutor

Request:
```json
{
  "title": "React Masterclass",
  "description": "Learn React from scratch to advanced level"
}
```
Response `201`:
```json
{
  "message": "Course created successfully",
  "course": {
    "_id": "64abc123",
    "title": "React Masterclass",
    "description": "Learn React from scratch to advanced level",
    "tutorId": "64tutor456",
    "createdAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

---

### GET /api/lms/courses
**Role:** Public

Response `200`:
```json
{
  "message": "Courses fetched successfully",
  "total": 2,
  "courses": [
    {
      "_id": "64abc123",
      "title": "React Masterclass",
      "description": "Learn React from scratch to advanced level",
      "tutorId": { "_id": "64tutor456", "name": "John Doe", "email": "john@example.com" }
    }
  ]
}
```

---

### GET /api/lms/courses/:id
**Role:** Public

Response `200`:
```json
{
  "message": "Course fetched successfully",
  "course": {
    "_id": "64abc123",
    "title": "React Masterclass",
    "tutorId": { "name": "John Doe", "email": "john@example.com" }
  }
}
```

---

### PUT /api/lms/courses/:id
**Role:** Tutor (owner only)

Request:
```json
{ "title": "Advanced React Masterclass" }
```
Response `200`:
```json
{ "message": "Course updated successfully", "course": { ... } }
```

---

### DELETE /api/lms/courses/:id
**Role:** Tutor (owner only)

Response `200`:
```json
{ "message": "Course and all related data deleted successfully" }
```

---

## SESSIONS

### POST /api/lms/courses/:courseId/sessions
**Role:** Tutor (course owner only)

Request:
```json
{
  "sessionTitle": "Introduction to React",
  "videoTitle": "React Basics - Getting Started",
  "videoDriveLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/abc123/view",
  "order": 1
}
```
Response `201`:
```json
{
  "message": "Session added successfully",
  "session": {
    "_id": "64sess789",
    "courseId": "64abc123",
    "sessionTitle": "Introduction to React",
    "videoTitle": "React Basics - Getting Started",
    "videoDriveLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/abc123/view",
    "order": 1
  }
}
```

---

### GET /api/lms/courses/:courseId/sessions
**Role:** Authenticated

Response `200`:
```json
{
  "message": "Sessions fetched successfully",
  "total": 3,
  "sessions": [
    {
      "_id": "64sess789",
      "sessionTitle": "Introduction to React",
      "videoTitle": "React Basics - Getting Started",
      "videoDriveLink": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/abc123/view",
      "order": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## TESTS

### POST /api/lms/sessions/:sessionId/tests
**Role:** Tutor

Request:
```json
{
  "questions": [
    {
      "questionText": "What is JSX?",
      "options": ["A styling library", "JavaScript XML syntax", "A database", "None of the above"],
      "correctAnswer": "JavaScript XML syntax"
    },
    {
      "questionText": "Which hook manages state in React?",
      "options": ["useEffect", "useState", "useRef", "useContext"],
      "correctAnswer": "useState"
    }
  ]
}
```
Response `201`:
```json
{
  "message": "Test created successfully",
  "test": {
    "_id": "64test999",
    "sessionId": "64sess789",
    "questions": [ ... ]
  }
}
```

---

### GET /api/lms/sessions/:sessionId/tests
**Role:** Authenticated

Response for **Student** (correct answers hidden):
```json
{
  "message": "Test fetched successfully",
  "testId": "64test999",
  "sessionId": "64sess789",
  "questions": [
    {
      "_id": "64q001",
      "questionText": "What is JSX?",
      "options": ["A styling library", "JavaScript XML syntax", "A database", "None of the above"]
    }
  ]
}
```

Response for **Tutor** (correct answers visible — full test object returned).

---

### POST /api/lms/tests/:testId/submit
**Role:** Student

Request:
```json
{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "64q001", "answer": "JavaScript XML syntax" },
    { "questionId": "64q002", "answer": "useState" }
  ]
}
```
Response `200`:
```json
{
  "message": "Test submitted successfully",
  "score": 100,
  "correct": 2,
  "total": 2,
  "breakdown": [
    {
      "questionId": "64q001",
      "questionText": "What is JSX?",
      "yourAnswer": "JavaScript XML syntax",
      "correctAnswer": "JavaScript XML syntax",
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "progress": {
    "overallScore": 100,
    "completionStatus": "completed",
    "completedSessions": 3,
    "totalSessions": 3
  }
}
```

---

## ENROLLMENT

### POST /api/lms/courses/:courseId/enroll
**Role:** Student

Response `201`:
```json
{
  "message": "Successfully enrolled in \"React Masterclass\"",
  "enrollment": {
    "_id": "64enroll111",
    "studentId": "64student222",
    "courseId": "64abc123"
  }
}
```

---

### GET /api/lms/students/me/courses
**Role:** Student

Response `200`:
```json
{
  "message": "Enrolled courses fetched successfully",
  "total": 2,
  "courses": [
    {
      "_id": "64abc123",
      "title": "React Masterclass",
      "description": "...",
      "tutorId": { "name": "John Doe", "email": "john@example.com" }
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## PROGRESS

### GET /api/lms/students/me/progress/:courseId
**Role:** Student

Response `200`:
```json
{
  "message": "Progress fetched successfully",
  "progress": {
    "courseId": "64abc123",
    "completedSessions": [
      { "_id": "64sess789", "sessionTitle": "Introduction to React" }
    ],
    "totalSessions": 3,
    "testScores": [
      { "sessionId": { "sessionTitle": "Introduction to React" }, "score": 100 }
    ],
    "overallScore": 100,
    "completionStatus": "completed"
  }
}
```

---

### GET /api/lms/tutor/courses/:courseId/students-progress
**Role:** Tutor (course owner only)

Response `200`:
```json
{
  "message": "Student progress fetched successfully",
  "courseId": "64abc123",
  "totalEnrolled": 2,
  "students": [
    {
      "student": { "_id": "64s1", "name": "Alice", "email": "alice@example.com" },
      "completedSessions": 3,
      "totalSessions": 3,
      "testScores": [
        { "sessionId": { "sessionTitle": "Intro to React" }, "score": 90 }
      ],
      "overallScore": 90,
      "completionStatus": "completed"
    },
    {
      "student": { "_id": "64s2", "name": "Bob", "email": "bob@example.com" },
      "completedSessions": 1,
      "totalSessions": 3,
      "testScores": [
        { "sessionId": { "sessionTitle": "Intro to React" }, "score": 60 }
      ],
      "overallScore": 60,
      "completionStatus": "in-progress"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## Error Responses

| Status | When |
|--------|------|
| 400 | Validation failure / duplicate |
| 401 | No token / not logged in |
| 403 | Wrong role / not the owner |
| 404 | Resource not found |
| 500 | Internal server error |

All errors follow:
```json
{ "message": "Descriptive error message" }
```
